{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>That they may believe, etc. the Elohim of their fathers.</b> The reason for His saying ״the Elohim of their fathers״ etc. time after time: perhaps He alluded that it would be impossible for a person to have dominion over the aspect of the serpent as seen in the sign, except to one to whom the Elohim of the fathers of the universe has revealed Himself. And therefore the matter would be a sign for him, for the Elohim of their fathers appeared to him, etc."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:24:17.186719640Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}